 R←Test_CreateAPI_015(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;noOf;cfg
⍝ Create API on a NS with 1 function & 2 operators (monadic & dyadic) while "Public" is a variable
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 Assert' '=1↑0⍴#.TEMP.⎕FX'r←Hello' 'r←''World'''
 Assert' '=1↑0⍴#.TEMP.⎕FX'r←x (fns Opr1) y' 'r←x fns y'
 Assert' '=1↑0⍴#.TEMP.⎕FX'r←x (fns1 Opr2 fns2) y' 'r←x.fns2 y'
 #.TEMP.Public←'Hello' 'Opr1' 'Opr2'

 cfg←##.Client.InitPackageConfig ⍬
 cfg.api←'API'
 noOf←##.Client.CreateAPIfromCFG #.TEMP cfg
 →T.PassesIf noOf=≢#.TEMP.Public
 →T.PassesIf #.TEMP.Public ∆LazyMatch(⊂'Public')~⍨' '~⍨¨↓#.TEMP.API.⎕NL 3 4

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
